B0B335D"}, "display_name": "Douyin VR Live", "keywords": [], "long_description": "1. Choices Abound: Enjoy trending streaming content at your fingertips with various streaming categories, including Talents, Gaming, Virtual Idol, Outdoors and Positive Vibes. \n2. New Experiences: See and hear content like never before with immersive and large-screen Douyin VR streaming. \n3. New Interactions: Get ready for the awesome experience of hand-giving a 3D gift, and watch your favorite streamers face off in intense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dXgdP2q__bMQ7kNvwHCmJyG&_nc_oc=AdrNB2mmMjB-T8y21otgYaCSpYQ7Tzq7Y-FZcasUYotAjyK9AeDjobF1_kYXvGu7h60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTKhWm6UVKdfgVgPIs7tV6lbEyTfu_a0hXdV0QtGdbH9w&oe=6B0B205C"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LRjQbJYpGUsQ7kNvwFuJC2g&_nc_oc=AdqHfM-wzA4gZ4c8aomSlUuNPtYdHYmrzAD8q3PqMavnPYZaiqajdmFW-ds9s5of3iw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSQH5D6S72VqCqoMt8b7JPOsnU2RcOLi-C499DjkBEyQg&oe=6B0B1B5C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_96192